flowchart LR
  logs[Compliance log generators]
  fluentd[Fluentd]
  hub[MDAI Hub compliance variables]
  vars[mdaihub-compliance variables ConfigMap]
  gateway[OTel gateway collector]
  router[Routing connector]
  filter[Non-critical logs path]
  compliance[Compliance logs path]

  logs --> fluentd
  fluentd -->|Fluent Forward| gateway
  hub --> vars
  vars -->|NON_CRIT_LEVELS CRIT_LEVELS CRIT_SERVICES| gateway
  gateway --> router
  router -->|non-critical levels| filter
  router -->|critical levels or services| compliance
